{"id": 991356, "slug": "where-is-billy", "name": "Where is Billy?", "name_original": "Where is Billy?", "description": "It's mischief night at Billy’s haunted mansion, and the host has quite the challenge in mind for all the monstrous guests! Partake in a hide-and-seek competition with an original twist: you don't know who you are, and the only place to hide is within the crowd. Can you find yourself in the sea of monsters and prove you’re the sneakiest, most perceptive player of all?<br/><br/><strong>Key Features</strong><br/><br/><ul><li><strong>Intuitive Multiplayer Gameplay </strong>: Jump into an easy to learn, yet hard to master hide-and-seek experience where discovering your own identity is just as crucial as uncovering your opponents.<br/></li><li><strong>Diverse Game Modes </strong>: Enjoy a variety of game modes, whether you prefer team-based or competitive challenges, each with its own set of roles and objectives.<br/></li><li><strong>Flexible Play Options </strong>: Play locally or online with 2 to 8 players, offering endless fun whether you’re hosting a party or joining one.</li></ul><br/><br/><br/>Discreetly figure out who you are, complete your objectives, and seek out other players—all while staying in character and avoiding detection. <br/><br/><br/><br/>Each game mode introduces distinct roles with specific objectives. Strive for the highest score and earn bragging rights on the endgame leaderboard that showcases each player’s performance.<br/><br/><br/><br/>Where is Billy? is for 2 to 8 players, either locally or online. Easily connect to other lobbies or open your own to fill up the party and keep the fun going through the matchmaking system.", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2024-10-25", "tba": false, "updated": "2024-10-28T08:39:41", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/73d/73d4267233a29d73c5a8b95163a51f55.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/974/974df